@# The bus stop needs authored controls; other civic/transport hubs are implicit.

:: place.bus-stop
  @hub bus_stop
  @choices "Activities"

  The route display at {{place.name}} is covered with times and destination names.

  @choice "Check the timetable" -> transit.bus-timetable

  @endchoice

  @choice "Wait for a bus" -> transit.bus-boarding

  @endchoice

:: transit.bus-timetable
  @choices "Timetable"

  The timetable lists the shared service used by every bus stop in the city.

  @choice "Return to the bus stop" -> @exit

  @endchoice

:: transit.bus-boarding
  @choices "Destinations"

  The bus pulls up and its doors fold open.

  @choice "Step away" -> @exit
  @endchoice
